# A HEAD AND NO PATTERN BLOCKS. The grammar permits it — a pure library
# file is exactly this shape — so pcrec must accept it and print head
# rows only, while run.sh must report "no pattern blocks parsed" on its
# own existing floor. The two outcomes are DISTINCT observables and this
# fixture is what holds them apart.
description a library file: definitions only, nothing to run
lib "definitions/common.rxt"
config dev
  flags i
